  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can summon hordes of creatures to serve at your command.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Superior Summoning<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Each time you cast a summoning spell that summons multiple creatures, if the spell’s level is lower than your mythic tier you may roll twice to see how many creatures are summoned, choosing the better result. If the spell’s level is equal to or greater than your mythic tier, you must spend one use of your mythic power to roll twice to see how many creatures are summoned.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This spell also applies to summon and summon monster spell-like abilities.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc98\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
